        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5115 Mortise Lever Set With 5006 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>This solid brass mortise leverset is available in a wide array of finishes but it is the sleek appearance that really sets it apart from other modern designs. Made by Baldwin, the Contemporary 5115 lever has concealed mounting screws and is designed to feel comfortable in the hand while still remaining stylish and sophisticated.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5115 Mortise Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Includes specially designed curved lip strike that is non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Small case mortise locks are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Modern Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5006 Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob hub to turnpiece spacing:  2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt:  .5\" x .625\" x .5\"</li>\r\n<li>Dead bolt: .5\" x  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Dimension:  .625\" x 3.375\" x 3.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate:  .156\" x 1\" x 5.75\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside by a separate privacy bolt thumbturn on inside.  An emergency key unlocks bolt from exterior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
